            <p>&lt;ID&gt; stands for this site's Google Analytics measurement ID. If you decline or make no choice, neither cookie is set.</p>
            <h3>Set on ClickUp's site, when you open the form</h3>
            <p>For your information: this list is based on the cookies we measured when the form was opened on ClickUp's site on 15 October 2026. ClickUp and its partners decide which cookies they set, so the list can change. The purposes follow the providers' public descriptions.</p>
            <div class="legal__scroll">
              <table class="legal__table">
                <thead><tr><th scope="col">Cookie</th><th scope="col">Provider (domain)</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Duration</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>_dd_s</code></td><td>Datadog (forms.clickup.com)</td><td>Performance: monitoring form errors and speed</td><td>Session, up to 1 year</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>ajs_anonymous_id</code></td><td>Segment (.clickup.com)</td><td>Analytics: anonymous visitor ID</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>analytics_session_id</code>, <code>analytics_session_id.last_access</code></td><td>ClickUp (.clickup.com)</td><td>Analytics: recognising the visit session</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
