            <p>ClickUp also writes app settings (Split.io feature flags) to browser storage under forms.clickup.com.</p>
            <p class="legal__note">The providers' own texts: <a href="https://clickup.com/terms/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ClickUp Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses cookies</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="basis">
            <h2>6. Legal Basis</h2>
            <p><strong>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics):</strong> these rely on your explicit consent (KVKK Art. 5/1). You give it by pressing “Accept” and can withdraw it at any time. Withdrawal does not affect processing that took place before it. Declining does not affect your use of the site or your application.</p>
            <p><strong>The <code>ls-consent</code> entry:</strong> this is strictly necessary to remember your choice and holds no personal data.</p>
            <p><strong>Netlify's server logs:</strong> the technical data relies on KVKK Art. 5/2-f, as explained in section 3.</p>
            <p><strong>Transfer abroad:</strong> Google processes Google Analytics data in the USA. This cross-border transfer takes place with your explicit consent for analytics (KVKK Art. 9) and under Google's data processing terms.</p>
            <p>Cookies set on ClickUp's site are ClickUp's own processing; you manage them with the tools ClickUp offers and in your browser settings. How the application details you send through the form are processed and transferred is explained in the <a href="/privacy/">Candidate &amp; Freelancer Privacy Notice</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="choices">
            <h2>7. Managing Your Choice</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>This site:</strong> use the “Cookie settings” link in the footer of every page to accept or decline analytics at any time. If you withdraw your consent, the Google Analytics cookies on librestudio.co are deleted and Google Analytics is no longer loaded.</li>
              <li><strong>Browser settings:</strong> you can also delete cookies and site data for librestudio.co in your browser. The banner then asks for your choice again.</li>
              <li><strong>ClickUp's cookies:</strong> delete cookies for clickup.com and doubleclick.net in your browser settings, or block third-party cookies altogether.</li>
              <li><strong>Applying without the form:</strong> just write to <a href="mailto:{{email}}">{{email}}</a>.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section id="rights">
            <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>To use your rights under KVKK Art. 11, see <a href="/privacy/#requests">how to make a request</a>. Requests are answered free of charge within 30 days at the latest.</p>
          </section>
